NOTE confidence=0.548 quality=0.548 halluc=0x0
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:54.600
Web has two main cameras, nearcam, a near infrared camera, and mirrory, the mid infrared instrument.

NOTE confidence=0.764 quality=0.764 halluc=0x0
